  "description": "Hello team,\n\nThe current Avalon session is running under Maya\u202f2023 for the **Hulk** project, targeting the asset **Bruce** in the **assets** silo. We are using the **polly** configuration and the work directory is set to `/mnt/projects/alita/assets/vector/maya`. The active task is **modeling**, and the session is labeled **Mindbender** for easy identification in the UI. For container management we rely on the identifiers `avalon.container` for containers and `avalon.instance` for instances.\n\nBackend services are pointed to the default Avalon database (`avalon`) and MongoDB at `mongodb://localhost:27017`. Deadline rendering is reachable via `http://192.168.99.101`, and Sentry error tracking is configured with the URL `https://5b872b280de742919b115bdc8da076a5:8d278266fe764361b8fa6024af004a9c@logs.mindbender.com/2`. Debug mode is enabled (`True`), uploads are allowed (`True`), and the default timeout is set to `1000` milliseconds. Authentication uses the credentials username **myself** and password **abc123**, and the projects root path is `/nas/projects`."
